  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BLAST- Promoting gender justice for women workers in the RMG sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Impact of the project : Violence against women (VAW) is reduced in the RMG factories, in public spaces and commute, and women&#x2019;s rights to safety in the workplace are protected, Outcome 1: The workplace culture at the RMG factories is free from violence and harassment and discriminatory practices and women workers have access to psychosocial, emotional, and legal services. Outcome 2: Women workers, including most marginalized, are free from violence in public spaces and during commute. Outcome 3: Apex agencies, brands/ buyers and Government authorities are engaged in ensuring an enabling environment for gender justice, through prevention of VAW and creating gender friendly workplace as per the labour law and are accountable to stakeholders. The project will be implemented at the factory, community, and national levels.</narrative>
  </description>
